Description:
    Creates the domain structure of Domain Driven Design (DDD).
    It creates a domain directory with the given name under app/domains.

Example:
    rails generate domains user
    rails generate domains order
    rails generate domains product

    This will create:
        app/domains/[domain_name]/
        app/domains/[domain_name]/.keep

    Put your DDD domain logic (entities, value objects, domain services,
    etc.) in the created directory.
